      "created_at": "2025-08-02T05:52:45.240Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, because your <strong>field names are different in doctype and importing file</strong>. You have 2 options to solve:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Make the field name similar in both.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Use “Map Column” option, this will bybass the check and will match the field with your preferred column in importing file.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
